## Key Concepts
- Circuit-breaking state machine per tenant
- Redis-based sliding window counters and failure rate computation
- ConfigMap-driven policy with hot-reload support
- Sidecar tenancy isolation via X-TENANT-ID routing
- Health and status endpoints for operability

